<para>This constructor creates an instance of <ref refid="class_a_g_e_1_1_gamepad_button_pressed_event" kindref="compound">GamepadButtonPressedEvent</ref> that represents a button press event on a gamepad device. The button parameter specifies which button was pressed.</para>
